{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29831","headline":"行次昭应县道上送户部李郎中充昭义攻讨 · 李商隐","name":"行次昭应县道上送户部李郎中充昭义攻讨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"将军大斾埽狂童，诏选名贤赞武功。\n暂逐虎牙临故绦，远含鸡舌过新丰。\n鱼游沸鼎知无日，鸟覆危巢岂待风。\n早勒勳庸燕石上，伫光纶綍汉廷中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}